  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Fix the package description, README links and CI paths\n- Validate the package API against 3.1.0 when packing\n- Stamp the assembly with the package version\n- Stop adding the README to projects that install the package\n- Default the handlers of Instance.Start(ProcessStartInfo) and stop capturing the context in StartAndWaitForExitAsync\n- Add KillEntireProcessTree to kill child processes too\n- Add CloseInput so programs reading stdin to its end can finish\n- Fault the wait instead of crashing when a data handler throws\n- Stop losing Exited events and bound Kill and cancellation\n- Detect a missing executable by its error code, not its English message\n- Make the output buffers safe to read while the process runs\n- Derive release notes from commits since the previous tag",
